@startuml
actor Developer
participant "GitHub" as GH
participant "Jenkins" as JNK
participant "Kubernetes Cluster" as K8S

== Start Deployment ==

Developer -> K8S: Check active color via helm list
Developer -> Local: Update Chart.yaml and values.yaml
Developer -> GH: Create branch and push changes
Developer -> GH: Open Pull Request

GH -> Developer: PR Approval Required
Developer -> GH: Approve PR

GH -> JNK: Trigger deployment via GitHub Actions
JNK -> K8S: Deploy opposite color release
K8S -> JNK: Report deployment status

Developer -> JNK: Review logs and endpoint
Developer -> K8S: Update Ingress/service to new release

== Deployment Complete ==
@enduml